  "notes": "USAGE:\nThe physical sense is used in industrial and medical contexts. The figurative sense is strong and dramatic — it implies total destruction, not just defeat. Common in political rhetoric and dramatic writing.\n\nFORMS:\n{粉|ふん} (powder) + {砕|さい} (crush, break) — to crush to powder.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {粉砕|ふんさい}{機|き}: crusher, grinding machine\n- {粉砕|ふんさい}{骨折|こっせつ}: comminuted fracture\n- {陰謀|いんぼう}を{粉砕|ふんさい}する: crush a conspiracy\n- {野望|やぼう}を{粉砕|ふんさい}する: crush ambitions",
